t-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px;\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b> Media Trends Executive </b>  Annual members receive the 2026 Annual Report, our special media document featuring global forecasts, sector analysis and exclusive media data insights.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n🔒 <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48246672.313342/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL21lZGlhLXRyZW5kcy1leGVjdXRpdmU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09aG91c2VfYWQmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW10ZV9hY3F1aXNpdGlvbiZ1dG1fY29udGVudD1RM19hbm51YWxyZXBvcnRfbWVkaWF0cmVuZHNfaG91c2VhZF9uZXdzbGV0dGVyQSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC02663486\"><strong>Get the report</strong></a> by becoming a Media Trends Executive member.\r\n</p>\r\n</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td height=\"10\" style=\"height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  2. 🫶 Pay it forward </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td> <img src=\"https://images.axios.com/P6T4vpkDcDB8uEVviLJX5Gw7gcc=/smart/2022/11/14/230410-1668467050275.gif\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:100%\" id=\"item03\" alt=\"Illustration of heart shaped bubbles floating upward\"> </td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.3\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#848484\"> <p>Illustration: Natalie Peeples/Axios</p> </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"15\" style=\"height:15px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><p><strong>Tonight's random act of kindness, </strong>shared by reader David Jones of Killarney, Manitoba, Canada:</p><ul><li><strong>\"Recently our daughter </strong>was diagnosed with leukemia. We received a quick note from someone whose husband was also receiving treatment for cancer.\"</li><li><strong>\"Just giving us</strong> a few tips of how to navigate the system, find parking, and simple things like what streets to avoid and what food was not edible at the hospital was such an act of kindness. It meant a lot, and we have been trying to pay it forward by doing the same.\"</li></ul></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48246672.313342/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtMGViNmZiY2MtNjcxYi00ODk3LWFlNDktYjBmMWQzMGI5OTkzLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC3b835608\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-facebook-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48246672.313342/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvdHdlZXQ_dGV4dD0lRjAlOUYlQUIlQjYlMjBQYXklMjBpdCUyMGZvcndhcmQmaGFzaHRhZ3M9YXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnVybD1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtMGViNmZiY2MtNjcxYi00ODk3LWFlNDktYjBmMWQzMGI5OTkzLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QyJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0R0d3NvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkyJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aCa743bc45\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\